#: src/pages/SupportPage.tsx:511
msgid "Each entry is a location that was masked — never the value."
msgstr "Each entry is a location that was masked — never the value."

#: src/pages/docs/concepts/ResiliencePage.tsx:79
msgid "Each input continuously writes its newest decoded frame into a small per-tile store; the compositor reads the latest complete frame from that store at every output tick and never waits for an input. When a source hiccups, the store simply keeps handing out the most recent frame it has — the \"last good\" one. A brief network blip can therefore be masked: the tile holds a fraction-of-a-second-old picture until fresh frames resume."
msgstr "Each input continuously writes its newest decoded frame into a small per-tile store; the compositor reads the latest complete frame from that store at every output tick and never waits for an input. When a source hiccups, the store simply keeps handing out the most recent frame it has — the \"last good\" one. A brief network blip can therefore be masked: the tile holds a fraction-of-a-second-old picture until fresh frames resume."

