msgstr "The open standard for playing a WebRTC stream from a browser: the player POSTs an SDP offer to a single URL and receives the answer, then media flows over the peer connection. Conspect serves WHEP for <0>webrtc</0> outputs and for the sub-second in-app live preview."

#: src/pages/docs/concepts/GlossaryPage.tsx:373
