#: src/pages/MeshPage.tsx:129
msgid "When on, this machine relays an offline neighbour's licensing heartbeat to the server and carries the signed response back. The payload is end-to-end signed — this machine cannot read, forge, or alter it, and earns no entitlement from carrying it."
